  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water to the boil.\n• Add basmati rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835030d8e7c0c766b829/step-1ca3e600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop tomato and cucumber.\n• Cut firm tofu into 1cm cubes.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cucumber, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste and set aside.\n• In a large bowl, combine tofu, All-American spice blend, the plain flour and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835030d8e7c0c766b829/step-aacfc510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook tofu, turning, until browned, 3-4 mins.\n• Remove from heat, then add the BBQ sauce and a splash of water, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835030d8e7c0c766b829/step-67276120.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir baby spinach and the butter through the rice until wilted and combined.\n• Divide rice between bowls. Top with American BBQ tofu and cucumber salsa.\n• Drizzle with dill & parsley mayo to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6964835030d8e7c0c766b829/step-6c2b1b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
